        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As discussed elsewhere in this Annual Report on Form 10-K, on April 23, 2026, we received a CRL in response to our NDA for GTx-104 referencing certain items in the chemistry, manufacturing, and controls and non-clinical sections of the application, which we believe we can address in a potential resubmission of the NDA.",
